# Validators and DTOs

- One Zod schema export per endpoint: `{ headers?, params?, query?, body? }`.
- Auth routes: `z.looseObject({ authorization: z.string().regex(/^Bearer\s+\S+$/) })`.
- Bodies: `.strict()`. Align `.max(n)` with `@db.VarChar(n)`.
- Plan DTO fields match User Service `SubscriptionPlan` (`id`, `name`, `label`, `monthlyCost`, `yearlyCost`, limits, feature flags).
- Do not import Prisma model types into controllers.
